{{ ref: 99a9b77c-77c5-42ba-9fc7-6462b834ef6d }}
- **Description**: syn for per-file parsing; the `ra_ap_*` semantic database for cross-crate name resolution over the cargo workspace. Macro-expanded references get confidence below 1.0 — honest uncertainty instead of silence. `cfg(test)` code classifies as test polarity and is excluded from production SLOC.
--{ ref: 99a9b77c-77c5-42ba-9fc7-6462b834ef6d }--

