> crates/adapter-rust/src/bind.rs (new)
  ```rust
  /// ra_ap-backed resolution across the cargo workspace
  pub fn bind(files: Vec<ParsedFile>, manifest: &Path) -> Result<IrFragment, AdapterError>
  // edge emission:
  //   use paths                  -> value-import (hard)
  //   type positions             -> type-reference (soft only where erased; rust
  //                                 types are mostly hard — they constrain compilation)
  //   trait impls                -> inheritance (hard)
  //   method / function calls    -> call (hard)
  //   pub use                    -> re-export, emitted as-is
  //   macro-expanded references  -> resolved kind with confidence < 1.0
  // polarity:
  //   #[cfg(test)] items, tests/ dir        -> TestCase
  //   shared test utilities (test-only use) -> TestSupport
  // bind failures (broken manifest, missing lockfile) -> AdapterBindFailure
  ```
--{ ref: 449717be-38b7-471f-9e97-7fb17978cf26 }--

